CHAPTER.VERS:
For the Chief Musician; [set to] Al-tashheth. [A Psalm] of David. Michtam. Do you

          {+}
         indeed in silence speak righteousness? Do you

          {+}
         judge uprightly, O you

          {+}
         sons of man?

No, in heart you

          {+}
         work wickedness; You

          {+}
         weigh out the violence of your

          {+}
         hands in the earth.

Before your

          {+}
         pots can feel the thorns, He will take them away with a whirlwind, the green and the burning alike.
